# --- Vendor-managed skill links ---
# Regenerated by setupAgenticToolkit("update"). Don't hand-edit or commit them.
# Keep authoritative copies of YOUR OWN local-extra skills in a tracked skills/
# folder instead - a link in here does not survive a clone, so if the only copy
# of a custom skill lives in .claude/skills/, a fresh clone loses it.
.claude/skills/

# --- Agent configuration ---
# Optional. If you ignore CLAUDE.md, remember NOTHING in it reaches a
# colleague's clone. Anything a human collaborator must know belongs in a
# TRACKED file (README.md / CONTRIBUTING.md) as well. See README section 7.8.
# CLAUDE.md
# .claude/
# .mcp.json


# ============================================================
# DO **NOT** ADD resources/project/ HERE.
# ============================================================
# It looks like generated MATLAB project metadata that belongs in .gitignore.
# It is not. Verified empirically: openProject FAILS outright without it -
#   "Unable to load the project at: <path>"
# It is also portable (zero absolute paths, zero usernames) and tiny
# (~126 files, ~10.7 KB - 0.07% of a typical repo).
# Commit it.
